<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GLB Club: Albuquerque</title>

<style>
:root {
    --field-white: #ffffff;
    --ink-navy: #002244;
    --meta-grey: #666666;
    --line-grey: #e0e0e0;

    /* Club Accent: High Desert Rust */
    --club-accent: #8c5a3c;

    --font-serif: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
    --font-sans: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: #111;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 50px 20px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

.placard-sheet {
    background-color: var(--field-white);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 580px;
    padding: 50px 45px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    border-top: 5px solid var(--ink-navy);
}

/* HEADER */
header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
}

/* OPTION B: ARCHIVE IMAGE */
.club-artifact {
    width: 100px;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    opacity: 0.95;
    display: inline-block;
    filter: grayscale(15%) contrast(110%);
}

/* TITLES */
h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    color: var(--ink-navy);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}

.club-established {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--meta-grey);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-grey);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-grey);
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
}

/* SECTIONS */
.narrative-block {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
}

h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--club-accent);
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
}

p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #222;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    max-width: 95%;
}

/* GROUNDS */
.grounds-block {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--line-grey);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.venue-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--ink-navy);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.venue-loc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--meta-grey);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

/* TIMELINE */
.artifact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
}

.artifact-list li {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.artifact-year {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--meta-grey);
    font-size: 11px;
    padding-top: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.artifact-detail strong {
    font-weight: normal;
    color: var(--ink-navy);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
}

/* FOOTER */
.record-ref {
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-grey);
    text-align: center;
}

.record-link {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--meta-grey);
    text-decoration: none;
}

.record-link:hover {
    color: var(--ink-navy);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="placard-sheet">

<header>
    <img src="club-albuquerque-rail-archive.jpg?v=1"
         alt="Rail infrastructure in Albuquerque"
         class="club-artifact">

    <h1>Albuquerque</h1>
    <div class="club-established">Est. 2024 &bull; New Mexico, USA</div>
</header>

<div class="narrative-block">
    <h2>Identity</h2>
    <p>The city exists at elevation, stretched between desert and mountain. Albuquerque developed as a rail junction and logistical hinge, where movement mattered more than permanence.</p>
    <p>The club draws from this condition. Its identity is not rooted in dominance but in endurance—operating efficiently in thin air, long distances, and sustained exposure.</p>
</div>

<div class="narrative-block">
    <h2>Grounds</h2>
    <div class="grounds-block">
        <span class="venue-name">Rail Yards Field</span>
        <span class="venue-loc">Albuquerque, New Mexico</span>
    </div>
    <p>Situated near the historic rail yards. Dry air accelerates ball travel while wide temperature swings alter night play. Sound carries farther here, but silence arrives quickly.</p>
</div>

<div class="narrative-block">
    <h2>Tradition</h2>
    <p>The club values spacing, patience, and conservation of effort. Games are treated as long hauls rather than short sprints. Preparation outweighs impulse.</p>
</div>

<div class="narrative-block">
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <ul class="artifact-list">
        <li>
            <span class="artifact-year">1880</span>
            <span class="artifact-detail">Arrival of the Atchison, Topeka and Santa Fe Railway.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="artifact-year">Mid-20th Century</span>
            <span class="artifact-detail">Expansion as a logistics and defense corridor.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="artifact-year">2024</span>
            <span class="artifact-detail"><strong>Charter Member</strong> of Global League Baseball.</span>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="record-ref">
    <a href="team-albuquerque.html" class="record-link">
        Official Statistics &amp; Roster available in Team Record
    </a>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
